rface intricately detailed with bones, scales, and gothic ornamentation. Her booted foot rests on a battered metal road case wrapped in heavy chains and covered in stickers and band decals.\n\nIn her right hand she grips a massive medieval war scythe, its long wooden shaft wrapped in leather, the enormous curved blade arcing dramatically over her head. Perched on her left fist, talons gripping her knuckles, is a majestic American bald eagle with pristine white head feathers and a sharp yellow beak, staring off to the side with predatory alertness.\n\nStudio lighting is hard and theatrical, casting crisp shadows. The composition is symmetrical, iconic, and poster-like — punk rock goddess of war meets American mythology. Hyperrealistic, high-fashion photography, 8k, sharp detail, magazine cover quality."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 98, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 104, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [464.6577453613281, 88], "pos": [1055.2794189453125, 1428.903076171875], "id": 66, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "VAE", "links": [100], "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "VAE"}], "size": [450, 120], "pos": [1048.7164306640625, 1564.463623046875], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_vae.safetensors"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "vae_name"}, "name": "vae_name", "label": "vae_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "vae_name"}], "flags": {}, "id": 67, "type": "VAELoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen_image_vae.safetensors", "directory": "vae"